    72	      # 125 min against the 360-min cap. Basis: the representative local split
    73	      # measured BUILD=35.53 min; the prior monolith reached its attack matrix
    74	      # at 105.22 min. Static stage analysis shows that the two non-attack
    75	      # stages each make one full mint pass over the same fixture, giving
