   752	) -> FloorEstimate:
   753	    """Raise a point-estimate floor to cover admitted energy sets.
   754	
   755	    The D-054 scatter calculation remains visible in its component fields, but
   756	    the operative unguarded/guarded floors can never be smaller than the
