docs/research_question_coverage-2026-08-28.md:168:There are **89 rows**: 79 live canonical identifiers plus 10 bank-only identifiers. The zero in B is substantive: `TRANSFER-FIDUCIAL-01` tests the load-regime transfer assumption attached to `RQ-ATTRIBUTION-DOMINANCE`; the registry contains no separate research-question row whose whole answer is that diagnostic. Its project task record fixes the approximately 500-millisecond, approximately ten-run design and makes it ineligible to support claims (`docs/process/state_kernel.json:4354-4420`).
